# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Secrets
#
# docker-compose.yml, README.md and docs/UPGRADING.md all tell you to create
# a .env here holding SECRET_KEY. Untracked is not the same as ignored: a
# `git add .` would otherwise stage a live JWT signing key, and anyone who
# has it can forge a token for any account and any role.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

